7. Final Development Result

The completed ComicCraft system allows a user to:

Enter an idea → Generate an AI story → Create characters → Divide the story into comic panels → Edit the content → Preview the comic → Save/Export the final comic.

This development approach makes ComicCraft a simple and interactive platform for creating personalized comics using Gemini AI.
